# Atlassian On-Prem Access

- Do NOT use Atlassian Cloud site assumptions (no `*.atlassian.net`).
- Preferred Jira URL: `https://jira-emea..org`
- Preferred Confluence URL: `https://confluence..org`
- For Jira issue browsing links, use:
 `https://jira-emea..org/browse/{ISSUE_KEY}`
- For Confluence pages, use:
 `https://confluence..org/pages/...`

When tool-based access is needed:
- Use the custom on-prem Atlassian MCP server/tools.
- If unavailable, explain the limitation and provide reproducible curl/REST commands.
- Never expose tokens in chat or committed files.
